so we're gonna get back to work.

308
00:20:16.949 --> 00:20:18.450
Oh. it sucks. man.

309
00:20:18.451 --> 00:20:20.885
That's a lot of wasted energy.

310
00:20:20.886 --> 00:20:23.688
I chased him for
