That's what that log is for.

321
00:21:29.421 --> 00:21:31.823
That's how I planned that
sawbuck to work. like that.

322
00:21:31.824 --> 00:21:34.359
Just like that.

323
00:21:34.360 --> 00:21:37.762
The spacer...
there you go.

324
00:21:37.763 --> 00:21:41.399
Put your log back over here.
Boom.

325
00:21:54.647 --> 00:21:57.950
Stomach...
it's cramping.

326
00:22:07.927 --> 00:22:11.062
<i>I don't think I've pooped
