331
00:22:23.008 --> 00:22:25.443
<i>or I just haven't been
eating enough.</i>

332
00:22:25.444 --> 00:22:28.813
<i>but I feel like I've eaten
enough in the last 12 days</i>

333
00:22:28.814 --> 00:22:31.716
<i>to be able to poop. though.
so I don't know.</i>

334
00:22:31.717 --> 00:22:33.718
<i>You start to get worried.</i>

335
