363
00:24:23.963 --> 00:24:27.665
<i>It would be amazing.
It'd be good eating too.</i>

364
00:24:27.666 --> 00:24:30.668
<i>For thousands of years.
Iñupiaq hunters</i>

365
00:24:30.669 --> 00:24:33.471
<i>would go out in order
