381
00:25:22.187 --> 00:25:24.188
<i>It's really important.</i>

382
00:25:39.471 --> 00:25:41.507
Yeah.

383
00:25:41.607 --> 00:25:42.640
it's a little discouraging.

384
00:25:42.641 --> 00:25:44.777
but still a lot of time.

385
00:25:44.877 --> 00:25:47.078
<i>I know that this black bear fat</i>

386
00:25:47.079 --> 00:25:48.513
<i>will be extremely important.</i>

387
00:25:48.514 --> 00:25:52.850
<i>I'm hopeful that this bear
is staying in my area.</i>

388
00:25:52.851 --> 00:25:54.886
<i>We'll see.</i>

389
00:26:15.941 --> 00:26:19.110
So have I shown you
how to eat rose hips yet?

390
00:26:19.111 --> 00:26:21.446
You pluck one. all right.

391
00:26:21.447 --> 00:26:25.516
You can suck all the meat out.
the part that meets the stem.

392
00:26:25.517 --> 00:26:27.885
Mmm. oh. yeah.

393
00:26:27.886 --> 00:26:30.321
And then...

394
00:26:30.322 --> 00:26:31.890
