395
00:26:40.365 --> 00:26:41.834
Mmm.

396
00:26:46.638 --> 00:26:48.707
Rose hips and sunshine.

397
00:26:50.075 --> 00:26:51.710
This is what I do every morning.

398
00:26:53.645 --> 00:26:55.247
This is my breakfast.

399
00:26:56.181 --> 00:26:59.550
I think today is gonna have to
be a foraging day regardless.

400
00:27:02.087 --> 00:27:03.988
Ooh.

401
00:27:03.989 --> 00:27:07.225
Something... holy [bleep]...

402
00:27:07.226 --> 00:27:08.993
has walked through here.

403
00:27:14.967 --> 00:27:18.035
That looks like...

404
00:27:18.036 --> 00:27:19.203
a cat.

405
00:27:21.406 --> 00:27:24.075
And...

406
00:27:24.076 --> 00:27:25.109
wow.

407
00:27:28.213 --> 00:27:30.715
Interesting.

408
00:27:30.716 --> 00:27:34.685
There is a lynx
wandering around.

409
00:27:34.686 --> 00:27:37.388
Um...

410
00:27:37.389 --> 00:27:39.490
so I'm gonna shift gears
and focus on

411
00:27:39.491 --> 00:27:42.426
getting a door on my shelter.

412
00:27:42.427 --> 00:27:45.229
I gotta get out of here.

413
00:27:45.230 --> 00:27:48.666
I need to make sure
that I have a shelter

414
00:27:48.667 --> 00:27:51.169
<i>that is going to keep me safe</i>

415
00:27:51.170 --> 00:27:53.671
<i>and protect me from predators.</i>

416
00:27:53.672 --> 00:27:56.974
