418
00:28:05.617 --> 00:28:08.120
24 is the width.

419
00:28:10.322 --> 00:28:11.890
OK.

420
00:28:13.358 --> 00:28:15.826
Well. I got lucky.

421
00:28:15.827 --> 00:28:19.231
Turns out the door
