423
00:28:31.543 --> 00:28:34.879
<i>I am not truly alone.</i>

424
00:28:34.880 --> 00:28:37.014
<i>There's predators here.</i>

425
00:28:40.953 --> 00:28:43.621
Oh. no.
Oh. perfect.

426
00:28:45.657 --> 00:28:47.558
<i>You know. I've always feared
the worst in life</i>

427
00:28:47.559 --> 00:28:50.394
<i>because the worst
actually did happen to me.</i>

428
00:28:50.395 --> 00:28:53.098
<i>So going into this experience.</i>

429
00:28:53.198 --> 00:28:56.467
<i>that is something
that I'm thinking about</i>

430
00:28:56.468 --> 00:28:59.437
<i>is worst-case scenario.</i>

431
00:29:03.675 --> 00:29:05.476
<i>I've been in positions
in my life</i>

432
00:29:05.477 --> 00:29:07.745
<i>where my agency has been stolen.</i>

433
00:29:10.148 --> 00:29:13.084
<i>I know what it's like
to be hunted.</i>

434
00:29:13.085 --> 00:29:15.386
<i>So yeah. being on high alert.</i>

435
00:29:15.387 --> 00:29:17.989
<i>knowing that there's predators
out there</i>

436
00:29:17.990 --> 00:29:19.957
<i>is...</i>

437
00:29:19.958 --> 00:29:22.059
<i>yeah. it's quite scary.</i>

438
00:29:25.364 --> 00:29:28.367
Well. I'm having a really hard
time today.

439
00:29:30.669 --> 00:29:35.473
<i>Being in this place
where I am suffering</i>

440
00:29:35.474 --> 00:29:37.475
<i>is starting to remind me</i>

441
00:29:37.476 --> 00:29:40.544
<i>of when I lost my agency.
when I lost control.</i>

442
00:29:40.545 --> 00:29:43.581
<i>when I was living
in a dark place.</i>

443
00:29:43.582 --> 00:29:46.917
<i>And I don't want
to go back there.</i>

444
00:29:46.918 --> 00:29:48.787
I think I'm just gonna sit here.

445
00:29:55.360 --> 00:29:59.196
21 years ago today.

446
00:29:59.197 --> 00:30:03.100
there was a young woman.

447
00:30:03.101 --> 00:30:05.537
19 years old...

448
00:30:08.206 --> 00:30:12.243
Just figuring out who she was.

449
00:30:12.244 --> 00:30:15.280
until one night.
her world changed.

450
00:30:16.648 --> 00:30:19.216
She was walking home.

451
00:30:19.217 --> 00:30:23.888
And on her way home.
she was kidnapped

452
00:30:23.889 --> 00:30:26.792
by two men

453
00:30:26.892 --> 00:30:30.161
who threw her into a car.

454
00:30:30.162 --> 00:30:33.764
held a gun to her head.

455
00:30:33.765 --> 00:30:38.069
took her to a park...

456
00:30:38.070 --> 00:30:40.304
where they beat her.

457
00:30:40.305 --> 00:30:42.640
they robbed her.

458
00:30:42.641 --> 00:30:45.476
and they raped her.

459
00:30:45.477 --> 00:30:50.349
They took their turns...

460
00:30:50.449 --> 00:30:53.951
destroying her

461
00:30:53.952 --> 00:30:58.322
before leaving her.
abandoning her

462
00:30:58.323 --> 00:31:00.324
broken.

463
00:31:00.325 --> 00:31:03.594
beaten. and bloody.

464
00:31:14.873 --> 00:31:16.875
That woman was me.

465
00:31:18.877 --> 00:31:20.912
That little girl was me.

466
00:31:25.650 --> 00:31:27.953
And it's been 20 years.

467
00:31:31.757 --> 00:31:34.558
And you can never move on
from that experience.

468
00:31:34.559 --> 00:31:36.628
but there is a way
to move forward.

469
00:31:41.366 --> 00:31:45.603
It wasn't until I started
to lean into nature

470
00:31:45.604 --> 00:31:48.140
that I found that I could heal.

471
00:31:49.608 --> 00:31:52.443
I dipped a toe into spirituality

472
00:31:52.444 --> 00:31:54.145
and therapy and nature.

473
00:31:54.146 --> 00:31:55.713
With those three things
combined.

474
00:31:55.714 --> 00:31:59.550
I found a path

475
00:31:59.551 --> 00:32:02.586
to feeling that I belonged.

476
00:32:04.756 --> 00:32:06.958
Nature taught me that.

477
00:32:08.326 --> 00:32:11.128
Nature taught me that
I belonged on this planet.

478
00:32:11.129 --> 00:32:12.898
So I studied it.

479
00:32:14.666 --> 00:32:16.100
Studied navigation.

480
00:32:16.101 --> 00:32:18.636
studied fire. studied plants.

481
00:32:18.637 --> 00:32:21.839
If I could protect myself

482
00:32:21.840 --> 00:32:23.174
and not let fear

483
00:32:23.175 --> 00:32:25.643
prevent me from having
a joyous life...

484
00:32:30.081 --> 00:32:33.517
Then that's what
I was going to do

485
00:32:33.518 --> 00:32:35.986
so I could become
fearless again.

486
00:32:37.956 --> 00:32:42.526
I'm proud of myself
for doing this.

487
00:32:42.527 --> 00:32:45.996
for taking on this challenge.

488
00:32:51.470 --> 00:32:54.205
